step("n17-boxes",S17,"Here are six numbers in boxes: 40,000, 7,000, 300, 1,500, 12,000 and 800. We can use addition and subtraction to make other numbers. The example makes 39,800 from 40,000 minus 800 plus 300 plus 300. Now we make 45,000: 40,000 plus 12,000 minus 7,000. For 5,900: 7,000 minus 800 minus 300. For 17,500: 12,000 plus 7,000 minus 1,500. And for 21,400: 40,000 minus 12,000 minus 7,000, plus 1,500, minus 300, minus 800.","பெட்டிகளில் ஆறு எண்கள்: 40,000, 7,000, 300, 1,500, 12,000, 800. கூட்டல் கழித்தல் பயன்படுத்தி வேறு எண்களை உருவாக்கலாம். எடுத்துக்காட்டு: 39,800 = 40,000 − 800 + 300 + 300. 45,000 = 40,000 + 12,000 − 7,000. 5,900 = 7,000 − 800 − 300. 17,500 = 12,000 + 7,000 − 1,500. 21,400 = 40,000 − 12,000 − 7,000 + 1,500 − 300 − 800.",[CL]+wr(["bxT"],0.02,0)+sh([f"bx{k}" for k in range(6)]+[f"bxt{k}" for k in range(6)],0.1,0.03)+wr(["bq0","bq1","bq2","bq3","bq4"],0.35,0.12))
qs("n17-q4",S17,"Using 12,000, 7,000 and 1,500, how can we make 17,500?","12,000, 7,000, 1,500 ஐப் பயன்படுத்தி 17,500 ஐ எப்படி உருவாக்கலாம்?","12,000 + 7,000 = 19,000:","12,000 + 7,000 = 19,000:",0,[O("12,000 + 7,000 − 1,500","12,000 + 7,000 − 1,500"),O("12,000 + 7,000 + 1,500","12,000 + 7,000 + 1,500","That gives 20,500, too much.","அது 20,500, மிக அதிகம்."),O("12,000 − 7,000 + 1,500","12,000 − 7,000 + 1,500","That gives only 6,500.","அது 6,500 மட்டுமே.")],"19,000 − 1,500 = 17,500.","19,000 − 1,500 = 17,500.")

