step("n18-make",S18,"Can we make 1,000 from 1,500 and 400? No. The only number smaller than 1,000 that we can use is 400, and 1,000 is not a multiple of 400. But 14,000 can be made: 1,500 times 8 plus 400 times 5. 15,000 is 13,000 plus 400 times 5. And 16,000 is 1,500 times 8 plus 400 times 10. Only 1,000 cannot be made.","1,500, 400 இலிருந்து 1,000 ஐ உருவாக்க முடியுமா? முடியாது. 1,000 க்குக் குறைவான ஒரே எண் 400; 1,000 என்பது 400 இன் மடங்கு அல்ல. ஆனால் 14,000 = 1,500 × 8 + 400 × 5. 15,000 = 13,000 + 400 × 5. 16,000 = 1,500 × 8 + 400 × 10. 1,000 மட்டும் முடியாது.",[CL]+wr(["mkT","mk0","mk1","mk2","mk3"],0.05,0.18,900))
qs("n18-q2",S18,"Which thousand cannot be made from 1,500 and 400?","1,500, 400 இலிருந்து எந்த ஆயிரத்தை உருவாக்க முடியாது?","Look at the smallest:","சிறியதைப் பாருங்கள்:",0,[O("1,000","1,000"),O("14,000","14,000","14,000 = 1,500 × 8 + 400 × 5.","14,000 = 1,500 × 8 + 400 × 5."),O("16,000","16,000","16,000 = 12,000 + 4,000, so it can be made.","16,000 = 12,000 + 4,000, உருவாக்கலாம்.")],"Only 1,000 is not possible.","1,000 மட்டும் இயலாது.")
ol=[("Largest all-odd 5-digit number between 35,000 and 75,000:","73,999 (repeating) or 73,951 (no repeats)"),("Smallest:","35,111 (repeating) or 35,179 (no repeats)"),("Closest to 50,000:","51,111 (repeating) or 51,379 (no repeats)"),("Sum 18,670 from one 5-digit and two 3-digit numbers:","18,000 + 300 + 370 = 18,670")]
for i,(a,b) in enumerate(ol): L(a,"od%da"%i,y=130+i*85,s=20,c="#16253F"); L(b,"od%db"%i,y=165+i*85,s=24,c="#2E7D32")
step("n18-odd",S18,"Now numbers whose digits are all odd, between 35,000 and 75,000. The largest is 73,999, or 73,951 if no digit may repeat. The smallest is 35,111, or 35,179 without repeats. The closest to 50,000 is 51,111, or 51,379 without repeats. Also, one 5-digit and two 3-digit numbers can add to 18,670: for example 18,000 plus 300 plus 370.","எல்லா இலக்கங்களும் ஒற்றைப்படையாக உள்ள, 35,000 க்கும் 75,000 க்கும் இடையிலான எண்கள். பெரியது 73,999 (இலக்கம் திரும்பினால்) அல்லது 73,951 (திரும்பாமல்). சிறியது 35,111 அல்லது 35,179. 50,000 க்கு அருகில் 51,111 அல்லது 51,379. மேலும் 18,000 + 300 + 370 = 18,670.",[CL]+[x for i in range(4) for x in wr(["od%da"%i,"od%db"%i],0.05+i*0.22,0.08,700)])
qs("n18-q3",S18,"The smallest 5-digit number with all digits odd, bigger than 35,000, is:","35,000 ஐ விடப் பெரிய, எல்லா இலக்கங்களும் ஒற்றைப்படை ஆன மிகச் சிறிய 5 இலக்க எண்:","Use the smallest odd digit, 1, after 35:","35 க்குப் பிறகு சிறிய ஒற்றை இலக்கம் 1:",2,[O("35,000","35,000","0 is not an odd digit.","0 ஒற்றை இலக்கம் அல்ல."),O("35,001","35,001","0 is not odd.","0 ஒற்றை அல்ல."),O("35,111","35,111")],"3, 5, 1, 1, 1 are all odd.","3, 5, 1, 1, 1 எல்லாம் ஒற்றை.")

